    "sentence_translations": [
      "Did you cut off your hand today?",
      "",
      "Little Le: I’ve been buying too many things recently. If I buy anything more, I will cut off my hand!",
      "",
      "Paul: Cut off your hand? Little Le, don’t scare me!",
      "",
      "Little Le: I’m kidding. I won’t actually cut my hand off, it's just a way of promising not to buy any more stuff.",
      "",
      "Paul: I see! But, I don’t believe you will be able to not buy things anymore.",
      "Look, the skirt you like is on sale now!",
      "",
      "Little Le: How can it be so cheap! I better just cut off my hand!",
      "",
      "Paul: Many items are on sale recently. I will cut off my hand together with you!",
      ""
